e that the rest of the  world is not going to accept us it can  put us in very low places  and for some that can lead to the  thought that I want to die hate to end  on a Saturday or dour note but this life  trans gender-fluid non-binary the whole  spectrum it can be tough and it's not  always sunshine and roses and sometimes  the reading that you can place a film  that and have it function as a trans  narrative isn't going to be a fun  but I still had fun doing this as a bit  of an exercise for myself in sort of and  to a certain degree projecting a trans  lens on some films did people enjoy this  around or were you confused as to what  the hell I was even doing I don't know  this it's a little bit of a weird one  for me but I hope you liked it whatever  your thoughts aren't drop something down  the comments let's talk about it  whole bunch stuff to do like subscribe I  have a patreon share this around all  that stuff but also you don't have to  because end of the day you're the  council I'm just running the meetings  and until next time this council is  adjourned  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

